  id: note_4
  title: "Note by the mirror"
  description: "Pinned up next to the clothes rack, signed J.H."
  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3189e4a0e0a7eb91a1d729df07a2ffeb, type: 3}
  kind: 3
  amount: 0
  text: "Every evening I dress the same way: shirt, then trousers, then scarf, then coat.\n\nEvery morning I hang it all back up, the last thing on goes first, on hook one.\n\nAnd the cap? The cap never comes off until I leave.\n\n\u2014 J.H."
